Uces
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 48 DEAL COLUMN
COLUMN 4 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank add_13
        SRC Suit {CLUBS, SPADES, DIAMONDS, HEARTS}
    DEST Suit {CLUBS, DIAMONDS, HEARTS}
MOVE_STACK COLUMN COLUMN
OR
    SRCSTACK Rank equal
    SRCSTACK Size < 8
DRAW
PILE ANY COLUMN Size > 0
$win
PILE ALL DRAW Empty
